### Assessment API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5071
@assessmentId = {{$guid}}
@shipmentId = {{$guid}}
@quoteId = {{$guid}}
@customerId = {{$guid}}

### 1. Receive Package for Assessment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assessments/packages/{{shipmentId}}/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quoteId": "{{quoteId}}",
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "trackingNumber": "TRK123456789",
  "deviceType": "smartphone",
  "deviceBrand": "Apple",
  "deviceModel": "iPhone 14 Pro",
  "originalQuoteValue": 899.99,
  "expectedCondition": "Good",
  "receivedBy": "John Doe",
  "receivingLocation": "Assessment Facility A"
}

### 2. Get Assessment Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assessments/{{assessmentId}}

### 3. Get Customer Assessments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assessments/customers/{{customerId}}

### 4. Get Inspection Criteria for Device Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assessments/devices/smartphone/criteria

### 5. Start Inspection
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/inspection/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inspectorId": "INS001",
  "inspectorName": "Jane Smith"
}

### 6. Complete Inspection
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/inspection/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inspectionResults": {
    "PowersOn": true,
    "ScreenFunctional": true,
    "BatteryHealth": 85,
    "PhysicalCondition": "Good",
    "WaterDamage": false
  },
  "actualCondition": "Good",
  "issues": [
    "Minor scratches on back cover"
  ],
  "photos": [
    "photo1.jpg",
    "photo2.jpg"
  ],
  "notes": "Device is in good working condition with minor cosmetic wear."
}

### 7. Generate Assessment Report
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/reports/generate

### Test scenarios with different device types

### Get Tablet Inspection Criteria
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assessments/devices/tablet/criteria

### Get Laptop Inspection Criteria
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assessments/devices/laptop/criteria

### Complete Inspection with Failed Critical Rule
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/inspection/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inspectionResults": {
    "PowersOn": false,
    "ScreenFunctional": false,
    "BatteryHealth": 45,
    "PhysicalCondition": "Poor",
    "WaterDamage": true
  },
  "actualCondition": "Poor",
  "issues": [
    "Device does not power on",
    "Screen is cracked",
    "Water damage indicators activated"
  ],
  "photos": [
    "water_damage1.jpg",
    "broken_screen.jpg"
  ],
  "notes": "Device has significant damage and cannot be powered on."
}